block content
  main.about-page
    section.about-hero
      h1 About Downtown Donuts
      p Family-Owned Since 1992

    section.about-content
      article.about-card
        h2 Our Story
        p Downtown Donuts started as a small family shop in 1992 with one goal: make fresh donuts and coffee for the downtown community every morning. Today, we still focus on warm service, simple ingredients, and a cozy place for customers to stop in.

      article.about-card
        h2 What We Care About
        p We believe a good morning starts with fresh food, friendly people, and a space that feels welcoming. Every donut is made with care, and every cup of coffee is served with the same neighborhood spirit we started with.

      article.about-card
        h2 Visit Us
        p 123 Main Street, Downtown
        p Mon-Fri: 6AM-6PM
        p Sat-Sun: 7AM-4PM